    <string name="dev_link_body">Hōʻike i nā komo a me nā polokalamu a pau o ke kīwī, hoʻololi i ke komo ma nā kīwī ʻaʻole hoʻolohe i nā pihi HDMI, a hoʻonoho i ka mālamalama ma kekahi. Holo ia ma ka pili debugging (ADB) o ke kīwī. Hana like nā pihi a me ke kikokiko me ia ʻole.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_developer">Ma ke kīwī, wehe iā Settings › System › About a koho iā Android TV OS build ʻehiku manawa. Ma nā kīwī kahiko, ʻo Device Preferences › About › Build ia.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_debugging">Wehe iā Developer options, ma ka ʻaoʻao o About, a hoʻā iā USB debugging. Ma ka Shield, ʻo Network debugging ia.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_allow">Paʻi iā Hoʻopili, a laila ma ke kīwī e kaha iā Always allow a koho iā OK.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_connect">Hoʻopili</string>
    <string name="dev_link_allow">ʻAe ma ke kīwī</string>
    <string name="dev_link_allow_body">Kaha iā Always allow from this computer, a laila OK</string>
