    <string name="dev_link_away_short">ʻAʻole pane mai</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off">Ua hōʻole ke kīwī i ka pili. Nānā inā ua ā ʻo USB debugging. Mai Android TV 14 mai, ʻae kekahi mau kīwī iā Wireless debugging wale nō, ʻaʻole hiki iā TennaRC ke hoʻohana i kēia manawa.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off_short">Ua pio ka debugging ma ke kīwī</string>
    <string name="dev_link_wireless">ʻO Wireless debugging wale nō ke ā nei, ʻaʻole hiki iā TennaRC ke hoʻohana i kēia manawa. Hoʻā pū iā USB debugging, a i ʻole e hoʻopālua hoʻokahi manawa mai kekahi kamepiula a holo iā adb tcpip 5555, e mau ana a hoʻomaka hou ke kīwī.</string>
